of expected use. As a result, the Company recognized additional depreciation expense of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zeo:AdditionalDepreciationExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12585">833,014</ix:nonFraction> during the six months ended June 30,
2026, which reduced the net carrying value of the internally-developed software to zero. The gross cost of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zeo:AccumulatedDepreciationOnRetirementOfAsset" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12586">1,286,879</ix:nonFraction> and related accumulated
