<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The carrying amounts of the Company&#8217;s financial
instruments, including cash and cash equivalents, accounts receivable, accounts payable, accrued expenses, and contract assets and liabilities,
approximate fair value due to the short-term nature of these instruments.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The carrying amounts of lease liabilities, note
