and paid cash distributions of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c234" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfDividends" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12795">160,153</ix:nonFraction> to holders of the Class A preferred units. The financial results of OpCo are consolidated with
