</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Net cash used in operating activities was approximately
$1.3 million during the six months ended June 30, 2026 compared to approximately $4.5 million during the six months ended June 30, 2025.
